        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dorothy Zbornak, Bea Arthur, Maude Findlay\n- Products: The Golden Girls\n- Concepts: fictional characters, acting portrayals\n\nFacts:\n- Bea Arthur, born Bernice Frankel on May 13, 1922, was an American actress, comedian, singer, and animal rights activist.\n- Bea Arthur portrayed Dorothy Zbornak in the TV series The Golden Girls for 7 years and 183 episodes.\n- Dorothy Zbornak, née Petrillo, is a fictional character from The Golden Girls.\n- Bea Arthur portrayed Maude Findlay and was an Emmy-winning actress.\n- Bea Arthur died on April 25, 2009.",
